"."]]},{"sentences":["Der Zuwachs an Traumquellen aus diesen unzweifelhaft festgestellten Tatsachen ist \u00FCbrigens nicht so bedeutsam, als man meinen m\u00F6chte. ","Der Traum ist ja ein Ph\u00E4nomen, das sich bei Gesunden -- vielleicht bei allen, vielleicht alln\u00E4chtlich -- einstellt, und das Organerkrankung offenbar nicht zu seinen unentbehrlichen Bedingungen z\u00E4hlt. ","Es handelt sich f\u00FCr uns aber nicht darum, woher besondere Tr\u00E4ume r\u00FChren, sondern was f\u00FCr die gew\u00F6hnlichen Tr\u00E4ume normaler Menschen die Reizquelle sein mag."],"tokens":[["Der"," ","Zuwachs"," ","an"," ","Traumquellen"," ","aus"," ","diesen"," ","unzweifelhaft"," ","festgestellten"," ","Tatsachen"," ","ist"," ","\u00FCbrigens"," ","nicht"," ","so"," ","bedeutsam",","," ","als"," ","man"," ","meinen"," ","m\u00F6chte","."," "],["Der"," ","Traum"," ","ist"," ","ja"," ","ein"," ","Ph\u00E4nomen",","," ","das"," ","sich"," ","bei"," ","Gesunden"," ","--"," ","vielleicht"," ","bei"," ","allen",","," ","vielleicht"," ","alln\u00E4chtlich"," ","--"," ","einstellt",","," ","und"," ","das"," ","Organerkrankung"," ","offenbar"," ","nicht"," ","zu"," ","seinen"," ","unentbehrlichen"," ","Bedingungen"," ","z\u00E4hlt","."," "],["Es"," ","handelt"," ","sich"," ","f\u00FCr"," ","uns"," ","aber"," ","nicht"," ","darum",","," ","woher"," ","besondere"," ","Tr\u00E4ume"," ","r\u00FChren",","," ","sondern"," ","was"," ","f\u00FCr"," ","die"," ","gew\u00F6hnlichen"," ","Tr\u00E4ume"," ","normaler"," ","Menschen"," ","die"," ","Reizquelle"," ","sein"," ","mag","."]]},{"sentences":["Den Hergang der Traumbilderentstehung auf Grund der Leibreize nimmt _Krauss_ folgenderma\u00DFen an: Die geweckte Empfindung ruft nach irgend einem Assoziationsgesetz eine ihr verwandte Vorstellung wach und verbindet sich mit ihr zu einem organischen Gebilde, gegen welches sich aber das Bewu\u00DFtsein anders verh\u00E4lt als normal. ","Denn dies schenkt der Empfindung selbst keine Aufmerksamkeit, sondern wendet sie ganz den begleitenden Vorstellungen zu, was zugleich der Grund ist, warum dieser Sachverhalt solange verkannt werden konnte (p.\u00A011\u00A0u.\u00A0f.). ","_Krauss_ findet f\u00FCr den Vorgang auch den besonderen Ausdruck der _Transsubstantiation_ der Empfindungen in Traumbilder (p.\u00A024)."],"tokens":[["Den"," ","Hergang"," ","der"," ","Traumbilderentstehung"," ","auf"," ","Grund"," ","der"," ","Leibreize"," ","nimmt"," ","_","Krauss","_"," ","folgenderma\u00DFen"," ","an",":"," ","Die"," ","geweckte"," ","Empfindung"," ","ruft"," ","nach"," ","irgend"," ","einem"," ","Assoziationsgesetz"," ","eine"," ","ihr"," ","verwandte"," ","Vorstellung"," ","wach"," ","und"," ","verbindet"," ","sich"," ","mit"," ","ihr"," ","zu"," ","einem"," ","organischen"," ","Gebilde",","," ","gegen"," ","welches"," ","sich"," ","aber"," ","das"," ","Bewu\u00DFtsein"," ","anders"," ","verh\u00E4lt"," ","als"," ","normal","."," "],["Denn"," ","dies"," ","schenkt"," ","der"," ","Empfindung"," ","selbst"," ","keine"," ","Aufmerksamkeit",","," ","sondern"," ","wendet"," ","sie"," ","ganz"," ","den"," ","begleitenden"," ","Vorstellungen"," ","zu",","," ","was"," ","zugleich"," ","der"," ","Grund"," ","ist",","," ","warum"," ","dieser"," ","Sachverhalt"," ","solange"," ","verkannt"," ","werden"," ","konnte"," ","(","p",".","\u00A0","11","\u00A0","u",".","\u00A0","f",".",")","."," "],["_","Krauss","_"," ","findet"," ","f\u00FCr"," ","den"," ","Vorgang"," ","auch"," ","den"," ","besonderen"," ","Ausdruck"," ","der"," ","_","Transsubstantiation","_"," ","der"," ","Empfindungen"," ","in"," ","Traumbilder"," ","(","p",".","\u00A0","24",")","."]]},{"sentences":["M. _Simon_ hat versucht, aus der Vergleichung einer Reihe von \u00E4hnlichen Tr\u00E4umen einige Regeln f\u00FCr den Einflu\u00DF der Organreize auf die Bestimmung ihrer Traumerfolge abzuleiten. ","Er sagt (p.\u00A034): Wenn im Schlafe irgend ein Organapparat, der normaler Weise am Ausdruck eines Affektes beteiligt ist, dur